<title>MACEDONIA: MACEDONIA STOCK VOLUME, TURNOVER RISE.</title>
<headline>MACEDONIA STOCK VOLUME, TURNOVER RISE.</headline>
<dateline>SKOPJE 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover rose to 7.303 million</p>
<p>denars at Tuesday's session of the Macedonian stock exchange</p>
<p>from 133,300 denars at the previous session on July 15 as only</p>
<p>one company traded, the exchange said.</p>
<p>Tsementatrnitsa USJE Skopje sold 254 stocks at 930 marks,</p>
<p>up 230 from the previous close and above par of 100 marks.</p>
<p>Listed companies trade in two floor sessions. The exchange</p>
<p>trades on Tuesday and Thursday.</p>
<p>($1=56.20 denars; 1DEM=30.92 denars)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-91188</p>
